Miku Emoji font - fan-made derivative artwork

The artwork depicts Hatsune Miku, a character owned by Crypton Future Media, Inc.
It is distributed under the Piapro Character License (PCL):
  https://piapro.net/en_for_creators.html

Summary of the terms:
  - Non-commercial use only. Selling this font or bundling it into a commercial
    product is not allowed.
  - You may redistribute it for free, as long as this notice is kept and the
    artwork is not modified in a harmful way.
  - The character must not be used in a way that damages the character's image.

The font file itself was generated locally from original drawings; the container
technology (CBDT/CBLC) is the same one used by Noto Color Emoji (OFL).
